  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Disease",
      "items": [
        "Retry, amend and turnover raced the read: one response showed one era's layout beside another generation's chat.",
        "The selected item wore the node aggregate's error and refusal; the done-only gate discarded its settled partial output."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Runner and reader never meet",
      "items": [
        "The runner commits when an item resolves - panel open or not, same bytes; the click writes only a local selection atom (test_selected_item_identity_cj2.py).",
        "With nothing picked, the detail view keeps the whole-node aggregate as its own read branch, never downstream of a selection."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "One record, or refusal",
      "items": [
        "A selection binds label, status, Output, Final and recorded chat to that item's own closed record - partial output included.",
        "A missing, stale or expired record refuses the content and the destination with zero host calls (test_selected_final_cj2.mjs, test_stored_session_nav.mjs, test_display_authority_pair_cj2.py)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Not claimed",
      "items": [
        "Panel behavior is observed through SDK/React test shims; native Electron and hosted acceptance are separate gates."
      ]
    }
  ]
